{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "surjective x^3:\n  surjective onto the reals: yes\n  proved: a polynomial of odd degree 3 is continuous and tends to -inf and +inf, so it takes every value (intermediate value theorem)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "surjective", "ucas": "surjective x^3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "surjective", "surjective_onto_the_reals": "yes", "proved": "a polynomial of odd degree 3 is continuous and tends to -inf and +inf, so it takes every value (intermediate value theorem)", "headline": "surjective x^3:"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "surjective x^3:\n  surjective onto the reals: yes\n  proved: a polynomial of odd degree 3 is continuous and tends to -inf and +inf, so it takes every value (intermediate value theorem)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "surjective x^2:\n  surjective onto the reals: no\n  witness: -1 is never taken\n  f is bounded below by 0: proved: an even-degree polynomial with a positive leading coefficient has a minimum, 0 at x = 0 (a root of f')\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "surjective", "ucas": "surjective x^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "surjective", "surjective_onto_the_reals": "no", "witness": "-1 is never taken", "f_is_bounded_below_by_0": "proved: an even-degree polynomial with a positive leading coefficient has a minimum, 0 at x = 0 (a root of f')", "headline": "surjective x^2:"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "surjective x^2:\n  surjective onto the reals: no\n  witness: -1 is never taken\n  f is bounded below by 0: proved: an even-degree polynomial with a positive leading coefficient has a minimum, 0 at x = 0 (a root of f')\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "surjective exp(x):\n  surjective onto the reals: no\n  witness: -1 is never taken\n  f is bounded below by 4.539992976e-05: proved by interval arithmetic: f >= 0; the smallest value seen is 4.539992976e-05 at x = -10\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "surjective", "ucas": "surjective exp(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "surjective", "surjective_onto_the_reals": "no", "witness": "-1 is never taken", "f_is_bounded_below_by_4_539992976e_05": "proved by interval arithmetic: f >= 0; the smallest value seen is 4.539992976e-05 at x = -10", "headline": "surjective exp(x):"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "surjective exp(x):\n  surjective onto the reals: no\n  witness: -1 is never taken\n  f is bounded below by 4.539992976e-05: proved by interval arithmetic: f >= 0; the smallest value seen is 4.539992976e-05 at x = -10\n"}, "isError": false}}
