{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "surjective sin(x):\n  surjective onto the reals: no\n  witness: 2 is never taken\n  f is bounded above by 1: proved by interval arithmetic: f <= 1; the largest value seen is 1 at x = -4.71238898 (~-3*pi/2)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "surjective", "ucas": "surjective sin(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "surjective", "surjective_onto_the_reals": "no", "witness": "2 is never taken", "f_is_bounded_above_by_1": "proved by interval arithmetic: f <= 1; the largest value seen is 1 at x = -4.71238898 (~-3*pi/2)", "headline": "surjective sin(x):"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "surjective sin(x):\n  surjective onto the reals: no\n  witness: 2 is never taken\n  f is bounded above by 1: proved by interval arithmetic: f <= 1; the largest value seen is 1 at x = -4.71238898 (~-3*pi/2)\n"}, "isError": false}}
